### 1. Create address (origin)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/addresses/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Sender",
  "street1": "123 Main St",
  "city": "Chicago",
  "state": "IL",
  "zip_code": "60601",
  "is_residential": false
}

###

### 2. Create address (destination)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/addresses/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Receiver",
  "street1": "456 Oak Ave",
  "city": "Los Angeles",
  "state": "CA",
  "zip_code": "90001",
  "is_residential": true
}

###

### 3. Create parcel
POST http://localhost:8000/api/parcels/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "length": "12.00",
  "width": "8.00",
  "height": "6.00",
  "weight": "3.50",
  "distance_unit": "in",
  "mass_unit": "lb"
}

###

### 4. Create shipment (use IDs from above responses)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/shipments/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address_from_id": 1,
  "address_to_id": 2,
  "parcel_id": 1
}

###

### 5. Get rates for shipment 1
POST http://localhost:8000/api/shipments/1/get_rates/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. Create transaction (purchase a label)
### Use a rate_id from the response to step 5
POST http://localhost:8000/api/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rate_id": 1
}

###

### 7. List all transactions
GET http://localhost:8000/api/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 8. Get a specific transaction
GET http://localhost:8000/api/transactions/1/
Content-Type: application/json